  "bodyHash": "Y48hvQ6uc7M=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個擴充模組新增了更多來自<strong><em>《Apex 英雄》</em></strong>的槍械。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>R-301卡賓槍</strong></span></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://imgpp.com/image/301.Cc0f8\" alt=\"\"></em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTbmDFZk/301.png\" width=\"716\" height=\"300\"></em></strong></span></p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>30-30連發步槍</strong></span></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PrqDL03x/3030.png\" width=\"761\" height=\"214\"></em></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>M600噴火輕機槍</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZRsCS58h/spirefire.png\" width=\"815\" height=\"328\"></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>克雷貝爾狙擊槍</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/J0XzJckp/kr.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"342\"><br><br></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組需搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mr. Crayfish's Gun Mod</a>&nbsp;才能運作。<br></span>1.20.1版本需使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod [非官方版]</a>。<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有槍械合成配方可透過設定檔修改。(1.12.2之後版本需解壓jar檔修改)<br><br></span></pre>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
